      "max_abs_library_correlation": 0.90148347
    },
    "regime_notes": "Positive full-history 20D Spearman IC and strong ICIR across 15 cross-asset instruments; recent 500-date diagnostics for the non-inverted calm-momentum form were negative, consistent with the reversal interpretation. High library correlation indicates substantial overlap with existing defensive trend/reversal signals and should be controlled in ensemble weighting.",
    "signal_artifact": "scripts/miner_3_20350705_calm_relative_reversal_signal.csv",
